              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Richard He"
            },
            "reviewBody": "The sweetness of the sauce + the bacon is delicious! Instead of grilling, I browned the bacon-wrapped chicken in a pan before baking it in the oven and it came out very well. Make sure to check with meat thermometer.",
